### Catalog API — manual requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
# Standalone the service listens on 8080. Under `aspire run` the host port is
# dynamic: copy the catalog endpoint from the Aspire dashboard into @baseUrl.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:51392

### Root — 200 text/plain "Catalog API is running."
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health — 200 {"status":"UP"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Categories — 200 ["Apparel","Bags","Drinkware","Stationery"]
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Products, default paging (page=0, size=8) — 200, totalItems 24, totalPages 3
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Products, second page of 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&size=5

### Products filtered by category — 200, 6 items
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category=Bags

### Products by name search (case-insensitive) — 200, mugs only
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?q=MUG

### Products by category + name search
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category=Apparel&q=shirt

### Products, max page size — 200, all 24 items
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?size=100

### Invalid: negative page — 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=-1

### Invalid: size above max (100) — 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?size=101

### Invalid: size zero — 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?size=0

### Product by id — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Product not found — 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/999999

### Invalid id (not a number) — 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/abc
